---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';

const title = 'Miguel Ángel López Hernández - Portfolio';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
// FormSubmit.co - servicio gratuito para formularios estáticos
const contactEndpoint = 'https://formsubmit.co/miguelhdez0903@gmail.com';
// Helper para construir URLs de certificados con encoding correcto
const certPath = (file: string) => `${base}certificados/${file.split('/').map(encodeURIComponent).join('/')}`;
---

<BaseLayout title={title}>
	<Header
		name="Miguel Ángel López Hernández"
		tagline="Full Stack Developer · React.js · Astro · Node.js · MongoDB · React Native · Three.js"
		photoSrc="/images/MiFoto.jpg"
		slot="header"
	/>

	<!-- Sobre mí -->
	<article id="intro">
		<h2 class="major">Sobre mí</h2>
		<span class="image right" style="max-width: 200px; height: 200px; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px;">
			<img 
				src={`${base}images/MiFoto.jpg`} 
				alt="Miguel Ángel López Hernández, Full Stack Developer"
				style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center center; display: block;"
			/>
		</span>
		<p>Soy Miguel Ángel, desarrollador Full Stack en México, especializado en la construcción de soluciones tecnológicas funcionales y orientadas a usuarios reales. He desarrollado aplicaciones web y móviles con impacto tangible, desde una plataforma de orientación vocacional con realidad virtual implementada a nivel institucional, hasta sistemas IoT con integración de hardware.</p>
		<p>Trabajo de forma integral en todo el stack: frontend con React y Astro, backend con Node.js y MongoDB, además de entornos especializados como Three.js y Arduino. Me enfoco en construir productos robustos, escalables y listos para producción, no solo prototipos.</p>
	</article>

	<!-- Proyectos Destacados -->
	<article id="work">
		<h2 class="major">Proyectos Destacados</h2>

		<!-- Proyecto 1: ExplorAR -->
		<Card
			title="ExplorAR — Plataforma de Orientación Vocacional VR"
			imageSrc="/images/img-projects/EXPLORAR.png"
			imageAlt="Logo de ExplorAR, plataforma de orientación vocacional con realidad virtual"
		>
			<p><small>Full Stack Developer &amp; VR &nbsp;·&nbsp; Sept 2025 – Dic 2025</small></p>
			<p>Los estudiantes eligen carrera sin información real sobre qué implica cada una, lo que genera deserción universitaria.</p>
			<p>Desarrollé una app móvil multiplataforma con tours virtuales 360° por carreras universitarias usando Three.js para experiencias inmersivas, con REST API propia en Node.js y MongoDB Atlas para contenido y analytics. Incluye panel administrativo web con dashboard de métricas de uso.</p>
			<p><strong>Impacto:</strong> Piloto implementado institucionalmente en CUOH para la carrera de Derecho.</p>
			<p class="card-stack">
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-react"></span>React Native</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-mobile-screen-button"></span>Expo</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-node-js"></span>Node.js</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-server"></span>Express</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-leaf"></span>MongoDB Atlas</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-cube"></span>Three.js</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-cloud"></span>Cloudinary</span>
			</p>
		</Card>

		<!-- Proyecto 2: GeoMap -->
		<Card
			title="GeoMap — Visualización Geoespacial Catastral"
			imageAlt="GeoMap, herramienta de visualización de datos catastrales territoriales"
		>
			<p><small>Frontend Developer &amp; Arquitectura Web &nbsp;·&nbsp; Dic 2025</small></p>
			<p>Los municipios no tienen una herramienta visual para gestionar y consultar eventos catastrales territoriales.</p>
			<p>Construí una interfaz web responsiva con mapas interactivos, geolocalización y módulos CRUD con filtros dinámicos. Diseñé la estructura NoSQL para los datos territoriales.</p>
			<p><strong>Resultado:</strong> Herramienta de apoyo para toma de decisiones municipales mediante visualización territorial.</p>
			<p class="card-stack">
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-html5"></span>HTML5</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-css3-alt"></span>CSS3</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-js"></span>JavaScript</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-bootstrap"></span>Bootstrap</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-leaf"></span>MongoDB</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-map-location-dot"></span>APIs de Mapas</span>
			</p>
		</Card>

		<!-- Proyecto 3: UniNest -->
		<Card
			title="UniNest — Búsqueda Segura de Alojamiento Universitario"
			imageSrc="/images/img-projects/UNINEST.png"
			imageAlt="Logo de UniNest, plataforma de búsqueda de alojamiento para estudiantes"
		>
			<p><small>Full Stack &amp; IoT Developer &nbsp;·&nbsp; Sept – Dic 2024</small></p>
			<p>Los estudiantes foráneos no tienen una forma confiable y segura de encontrar alojamiento cerca de su universidad.</p>
			<p>Desarrollé una plataforma web con autenticación, gestión de usuarios y listados verificados de arrendamiento con geolocalización. Integré un sistema de control de acceso físico mediante tarjetas RFID conectado al backend.</p>
			<p class="card-stack">
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-react"></span>React Native</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-leaf"></span>MongoDB</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-map-location-dot"></span>Google Maps API</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-id-card"></span>RFID</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-plug"></span>Backend REST</span>
			</p>
		</Card>

		<!-- Proyecto 4: SafeCheck School -->
		<Card
			title="SafeCheck School — Control de Acceso Escolar con IoT"
			imageSrc="/images/img-projects/SAFECHECK.png"
			imageAlt="Logo de SafeCheck School, sistema de control de acceso con detección de alcohol"
		>
			<p><small>Full Stack &amp; IoT Developer &nbsp;·&nbsp; Ene – May 2024</small></p>
			<p>Las instituciones educativas no tienen una forma automatizada de controlar accesos y detectar alcohol en el ingreso.</p>
			<p>Desarrollé un sistema web y móvil con integración hardware-software usando Arduino y sensores MQ para detección de alcohol. La identificación de usuarios se realiza por código QR con un panel administrativo web para gestión de registros.</p>
			<p class="card-stack">
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-react"></span>React Native</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-leaf"></span>MongoDB</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-microchip"></span>Arduino</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-flask"></span>Sensores MQ</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-qrcode"></span>QR</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-bootstrap"></span>Bootstrap</span>
			</p>
		</Card>

		<!-- Proyecto 5: ReCou — Hackathon UTEC -->
		<Card
			title="ReCou — Localizador de Centros de Donación"
			imageSrc="/images/img-projects/RECOU_LOGOTIPO_blanco.png"
			imageAlt="Logo de ReCou, localizador de centros de donación de PET y aluminio"
		>
			<p><small>Frontend &amp; Backend Developer &nbsp;·&nbsp; Nov 2023 · Hackathon UTEC</small></p>
			<p>Las personas que quieren donar PET y aluminio para fabricación de prótesis no saben dónde hacerlo.</p>
			<p>Construí una aplicación web para localizar centros de donación con enfoque en impacto social y ambiental comunitario.</p>
			<p><strong>Resultado:</strong> Proyecto ganador del Hackathon UTEC.</p>
			<p class="card-stack">
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-js"></span>JavaScript</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-html5"></span>HTML5</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-python"></span>Python</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-database"></span>SQLite</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon solid fa-palette"></span>Materialize CSS</span>
				<span class="tech-badge"><span class="icon brands fa-bootstrap"></span>Bootstrap</span>
			</p>
		</Card>
	</article>

	<!-- Stack Tecnológico -->
	<article id="about">
		<h2 class="major">Stack Tecnológico</h2>

		<div class="tech-wrap">

			<!-- Interfaz -->
			<section class="tech-group">
				<h4>Interfaz</h4>
				<div class="tech-badges">
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 0ms"><span class="icon brands fa-react"></span>React.js</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 80ms"><span class="icon solid fa-rocket"></span>Astro</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 160ms"><span class="icon brands fa-html5"></span>HTML5</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 240ms"><span class="icon brands fa-css3-alt"></span>CSS3</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 320ms"><span class="icon brands fa-js"></span>JavaScript</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 400ms"><span class="icon solid fa-wind"></span>Tailwind CSS</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 480ms"><span class="icon brands fa-bootstrap"></span>Bootstrap</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Mobile -->
			<section class="tech-group">
				<h4>Mobile</h4>
				<div class="tech-badges">
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 0ms"><span class="icon brands fa-react"></span>React Native</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 80ms"><span class="icon solid fa-mobile-screen-button"></span>Expo</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Backend -->
			<section class="tech-group">
				<h4>Backend</h4>
				<div class="tech-badges">
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 0ms"><span class="icon brands fa-node-js"></span>Node.js</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 80ms"><span class="icon solid fa-server"></span>Express.js</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 160ms"><span class="icon brands fa-python"></span>Python</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 240ms"><span class="icon brands fa-php"></span>PHP</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Bases de datos -->
			<section class="tech-group">
				<h4>Bases de datos</h4>
				<div class="tech-badges">
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 0ms"><span class="icon solid fa-leaf"></span>MongoDB Atlas</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 80ms"><span class="icon solid fa-database"></span>MySQL</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 160ms"><span class="icon solid fa-database"></span>SQLite</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Inmersivo & IoT -->
			<section class="tech-group">
				<h4>Inmersivo &amp; IoT</h4>
				<div class="tech-badges">
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 0ms"><span class="icon solid fa-cube"></span>Three.js</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 80ms"><span class="icon solid fa-microchip"></span>Arduino</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 160ms"><span class="icon solid fa-wifi"></span>ESP32</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 240ms"><span class="icon solid fa-flask"></span>Sensores MQ</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 320ms"><span class="icon solid fa-id-card"></span>RFID</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 400ms"><span class="icon solid fa-qrcode"></span>QR</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Cloud & DevOps -->
			<section class="tech-group">
				<h4>Cloud &amp; DevOps</h4>
				<div class="tech-badges">
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 0ms"><span class="icon brands fa-aws"></span>AWS</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 80ms"><span class="icon solid fa-cloud"></span>Cloudinary</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 160ms"><span class="icon solid fa-map-location-dot"></span>Google Maps API</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 240ms"><span class="icon brands fa-git-alt"></span>Git</span>
					<span class="tech-badge" style="--d: 320ms"><span class="icon brands fa-github"></span>GitHub</span>
				</div>
			</section>

		</div>
	</article>

	<!-- Cursos y Certificaciones -->
	<article id="certs">
		<h2 class="major">Cursos y Certificaciones</h2>
		<p>Formación verificable en plataformas oficiales. Haz clic en cualquier certificado para verlo al instante.</p>

		<!-- Grid horizontal de tarjetas -->
		<div class="cert-grid">

			<!-- Amazon Web Services -->
			<div class="cert-card">
				<header class="cert-card-head">
					<span class="icon brands fa-aws cert-icon"></span>
					<h3>Amazon Web Services</h3>
					<span class="cert-tag">Cursos oficiales</span>
				</header>
				<div class="cert-pdf-pills">
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('Amazon EC2 Basics.pdf')} data-label="Amazon EC2 Basics">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>EC2 Basics
					</button>
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('Getting Started with DevOps.pdf')} data-label="Getting Started with DevOps">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Getting Started with DevOps
					</button>
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('Domain 3 Review AWS Certified Solutions.pdf')} data-label="Domain 3 Review — AWS Solutions Architect">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Solutions Architect
					</button>
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('Official Practice Question Set AWS.pdf')} data-label="Official Practice Question Set — AWS">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Practice Question Set
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- MongoDB University -->
			<div class="cert-card cert-card--mongo">
				<header class="cert-card-head">
					<span class="icon solid fa-leaf cert-icon cert-icon--mongo"></span>
					<h3>MongoDB University</h3>
					<span class="cert-tag cert-tag--official">Certificación oficial</span>
				</header>
				<div class="cert-pdf-pills">
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill cert-pdf-pill--main" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/CERTIDICADO DE MONGO.pdf')} data-label="Certificado General MongoDB — Miguel Ángel López Hernández">
						<span class="icon solid fa-award"></span>Ver Certificado Principal
					</button>
				</div>
				<details class="cert-modules">
					<summary><span class="icon solid fa-folder-open"></span>&nbsp;13 módulos completados</summary>
					<div class="cert-pdf-pills cert-pdf-pills--sm">
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/Introduccion de mongo.pdf')} data-label="Introducción a MongoDB"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Introducción</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/getting started with mongodb Atlas.pdf')} data-label="Getting Started with MongoDB Atlas"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Atlas</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/Connecting to a MongoDB DataBase.pdf')} data-label="Connecting to a MongoDB Database"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Connecting</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB and the Document Model.pdf')} data-label="MongoDB and the Document Model"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Document Model</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB CRUP Operations Insert and Find Document.pdf')} data-label="CRUD — Insert & Find"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Insert &amp; Find</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB CRUP Operations Modifying Query Results.pdf')} data-label="CRUD — Modifying Query Results"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Query Results</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB CRUP Operations Replace and Detele Document.pdf')} data-label="CRUD — Replace & Delete"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Replace &amp; Delete</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/Mongo DB Data MOdeling Intro.pdf')} data-label="Data Modeling Intro"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Data Modeling</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB Aggregation.pdf')} data-label="Aggregation"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Aggregation</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB Indexes.pdf')} data-label="Indexes"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Indexes</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB Atlas Search.pdf')} data-label="Atlas Search"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Atlas Search</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/MongoDB Transactions.pdf')} data-label="Transactions"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Transactions</button>
						<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('CERTIFICADOS/CERTIDICADO DE MONGO.pdf')} data-label="Certificado General MongoDB"><span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Cert. General</button>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>

			<!-- freeCodeCamp -->
			<div class="cert-card cert-card--fcc cert-card--wide">
				<header class="cert-card-head">
					<span class="icon solid fa-fire-flame-curved cert-icon cert-icon--fcc"></span>
					<h3>freeCodeCamp</h3>
					<span class="cert-tag cert-tag--official">Certificaciones oficiales</span>
				</header>
				<div class="cert-img-strip">
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('JavaScript.png')} data-label="JavaScript Algorithms & Data Structures — freeCodeCamp">
						<img src={certPath('JavaScript.png')} alt="Certificado JavaScript" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">JavaScript</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('html certificado.png')} data-label="HTML — freeCodeCamp">
						<img src={certPath('html certificado.png')} alt="Certificado HTML" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">HTML</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('Diseño webresponsive-web-design-v9.png')} data-label="Responsive Web Design v9 — freeCodeCamp">
						<img src={certPath('Diseño webresponsive-web-design-v9.png')} alt="Responsive Web Design v9" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Responsive v9</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('diseño web adaptable heredado V8.png')} data-label="Diseño Web Adaptable Heredado V8 — freeCodeCamp">
						<img src={certPath('diseño web adaptable heredado V8.png')} alt="Diseño Web Adaptable V8" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Adaptable V8</span>
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- IA & Prompt Engineering -->
			<div class="cert-card cert-card--ia cert-card--wide">
				<header class="cert-card-head">
					<span class="icon solid fa-brain cert-icon" style="color:#a78bfa"></span>
					<h3>IA &amp; Prompt Engineering</h3>
					<span class="cert-tag">Cursos complementarios</span>
				</header>
				<div class="cert-img-strip">
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('Iniciacion al Desarrollo con IA.png')} data-label="Iniciación al Desarrollo con IA">
						<img src={certPath('Iniciacion al Desarrollo con IA.png')} alt="Iniciación al Desarrollo con IA" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Iniciación con IA</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('chatgpt for everyone.png')} data-label="ChatGPT for Everyone">
						<img src={certPath('chatgpt for everyone.png')} alt="ChatGPT for Everyone" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">ChatGPT for Everyone</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('intro to prompt hacking.png')} data-label="Intro to Prompt Hacking">
						<img src={certPath('intro to prompt hacking.png')} alt="Intro to Prompt Hacking" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Intro Prompt Hacking</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('Advanced prompt hacking.png')} data-label="Advanced Prompt Hacking">
						<img src={certPath('Advanced prompt hacking.png')} alt="Advanced Prompt Hacking" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Advanced Prompt Hacking</span>
					</button>
				</div>
				<div class="cert-pdf-pills">
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('Introduction to Generative AI - Art.pdf')} data-label="Introduction to Generative AI — Art">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Generative AI — Art
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Idiomas -->
			<div class="cert-card">
				<header class="cert-card-head">
					<span class="icon solid fa-language cert-icon" style="color:#60a5fa"></span>
					<h3>Idiomas</h3>
					<span class="cert-tag cert-tag--official">Certificación oficial</span>
				</header>
				<div class="cert-img-strip">
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('diploma de Ingles A2.png')} data-label="Diploma de Inglés A2">
						<img src={certPath('diploma de Ingles A2.png')} alt="Diploma de Inglés A2" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Inglés A2</span>
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Otros certificados -->
			<div class="cert-card">
				<header class="cert-card-head">
					<span class="icon solid fa-certificate cert-icon" style="color:#fbbf24"></span>
					<h3>Otros Certificados</h3>
					<span class="cert-tag">Varios</span>
				</header>
				<div class="cert-img-strip">
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('Captura de pantalla 2025-03-31 092920.png')} data-label="Certificado — Mar 2025">
						<img src={certPath('Captura de pantalla 2025-03-31 092920.png')} alt="Certificado Mar 2025" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Mar 2025</span>
					</button>
					<button class="cert-img-thumb" data-src={certPath('Captura de pantalla 2025-04-07 141049.png')} data-label="Certificado — Abr 2025">
						<img src={certPath('Captura de pantalla 2025-04-07 141049.png')} alt="Certificado Abr 2025" loading="lazy" />
						<span class="cert-img-thumb-label">Abr 2025</span>
					</button>
				</div>
				<div class="cert-pdf-pills">
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('certificate-3wzb2tucguho-1769187412.pdf')} data-label="Certificado (3wzb2tucguho)">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Cert. A
					</button>
					<button class="cert-pdf-pill" data-pdf={certPath('certificate-7jebjztermhb-1769185102.pdf')} data-label="Certificado (7jebjztermhb)">
						<span class="icon solid fa-file-pdf"></span>Cert. B
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div><!-- /.cert-grid -->

		<!-- Visor unificado: imágenes y PDFs inline -->
		<div id="cert-viewer" class="cv-root" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Visor de certificado">
			<div class="cv-backdrop"></div>
			<div class="cv-shell">
				<div class="cv-toolbar">
					<span class="cv-title"></span>
					<div class="cv-actions">
						<a class="cv-btn cv-open-tab" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Abrir en nueva pestaña">
							<span class="icon solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></span>
							<span>Nueva pestaña</span>
						</a>
					</div>
					<button class="cv-close" aria-label="Cerrar">&#x2715;</button>
				</div>
				<div class="cv-body">
					<div class="cv-loading">
						<div class="cv-spinner"></div>
						<span>Cargando…</span>
					</div>
					<img class="cv-img" src="" alt="" />
					<iframe class="cv-iframe" src="" title="Visor de certificado PDF" hidden></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<script is:inline>
			(function () {
				/* ──── Visor (imagen + PDF) ──── */
				var viewer   = document.getElementById('cert-viewer');
				if (!viewer) return;
				if (viewer.parentElement !== document.body) {
					document.body.appendChild(viewer);
				}
				var pdfLoadTimer;
				var cvTitle   = viewer.querySelector('.cv-title');
				var cvClose   = viewer.querySelector('.cv-close');
				var cvBackdrop = viewer.querySelector('.cv-backdrop');
				var cvImg     = viewer.querySelector('.cv-img');
				var cvIframe  = viewer.querySelector('.cv-iframe');
				var cvLoading = viewer.querySelector('.cv-loading');
				var cvOpenTab = viewer.querySelector('.cv-open-tab');

				function showLoad() { if (cvLoading) cvLoading.hidden = false; }
				function hideLoad() { if (cvLoading) cvLoading.hidden = true; }

				function openViewer(type, src, label) {
					cvTitle.textContent = label;
					if (cvOpenTab) cvOpenTab.href = src;
					showLoad();
					if (type === 'img') {
						cvIframe.hidden = true;
						cvIframe.src = '';
						cvImg.hidden = false;
						cvImg.onload = hideLoad;
						cvImg.onerror = hideLoad;
						cvImg.src = src;
						cvImg.alt = label;
						if (cvImg.complete) hideLoad();
					} else {
						cvImg.hidden = true;
						cvImg.src = '';
						cvIframe.hidden = false;
						clearTimeout(pdfLoadTimer);

						if (src.toLowerCase().endsWith('.pdf')) {
							cvIframe.src = src + '#view=FitH&toolbar=1&navpanes=0&scrollbar=1';
						} else {
							cvIframe.src = src;
						}

						cvIframe.onload = function() { clearTimeout(pdfLoadTimer); hideLoad(); };
						/* Chrome no dispara onload en PDFs — ocultar spinner tras 4 s de espera */
						pdfLoadTimer = setTimeout(hideLoad, 4000);
					}
					viewer.hidden = false;
					document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
				}

				function closeViewer() {
					viewer.hidden = true;
					clearTimeout(pdfLoadTimer);
					cvIframe.src = '';
					cvImg.src = '';
					cvImg.hidden = false;
					cvIframe.hidden = true;
					hideLoad();
					document.body.style.overflow = '';
				}

				function swallowViewerClick(e) {
					e.preventDefault();
					e.stopPropagation();
				}

				function onViewerEscape(e) {
					if (viewer.hidden || e.key !== 'Escape') return;
					e.preventDefault();
					e.stopPropagation();
					if (typeof e.stopImmediatePropagation === 'function') e.stopImmediatePropagation();
					closeViewer();
				}

				document.querySelectorAll('.cert-img-thumb').forEach(function (btn) {
					btn.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
						e.preventDefault();
						e.stopPropagation();
						openViewer('img', btn.dataset.src, btn.dataset.label);
					});
				});
				document.querySelectorAll('.cert-pdf-pill').forEach(function (btn) {
					btn.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
						e.preventDefault();
						e.stopPropagation();
						openViewer('pdf', btn.dataset.pdf, btn.dataset.label);
					});
				});
				viewer.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
					if (!viewer.hidden) e.stopPropagation();
				});
				viewer.querySelector('.cv-shell').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
					e.stopPropagation();
				});
				cvClose.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
					swallowViewerClick(e);
					closeViewer();
				});
				cvBackdrop.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
					swallowViewerClick(e);
					closeViewer();
				});
				window.addEventListener('keydown', onViewerEscape, true);
				window.addEventListener('keyup', onViewerEscape, true);

				/* ──── Animación de entrada de tarjetas (IntersectionObserver) ──── */
				var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.cert-card');
				if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
					var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
						var delay = 0;
						entries.forEach(function (entry) {
							if (entry.isIntersecting) {
								entry.target.style.setProperty('--cert-delay', delay + 'ms');
								entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
								delay += 80;
								io.unobserve(entry.target);
							}
						});
					}, { threshold: 0.1 });
					cards.forEach(function (card) { io.observe(card); });
				} else {
					/* Fallback sin IO */
					cards.forEach(function (card) { card.classList.add('is-visible'); });
				}

				/* ──── Drag-to-scroll en strips de imágenes ──── */
				document.querySelectorAll('.cert-img-strip').forEach(function (strip) {
					var isDown = false;
					var startX = 0;
					var scrollLeft = 0;
					var moved = false;

					strip.addEventListener('mousedown', function (e) {
						isDown = true;
						moved = false;
						strip.classList.add('is-dragging');
						startX = e.pageX - strip.offsetLeft;
						scrollLeft = strip.scrollLeft;
					});
					strip.addEventListener('mouseleave', function () {
						isDown = false;
						strip.classList.remove('is-dragging');
					});
					strip.addEventListener('mouseup', function () {
						isDown = false;
						strip.classList.remove('is-dragging');
					});
					strip.addEventListener('mousemove', function (e) {
						if (!isDown) return;
						e.preventDefault();
						var x = e.pageX - strip.offsetLeft;
						var walk = (x - startX) * 1.4;
						if (Math.abs(walk) > 4) moved = true;
						strip.scrollLeft = scrollLeft - walk;
					});
					/* Cancelar click en botones hijos si hubo arrastre */
					strip.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
						if (moved) e.stopPropagation();
					}, true);
				});
			})();
		</script>
	</article>

	<!-- Contact -->
	<article id="contact">
		<h2 class="major">Contacto</h2>
		<form id="contact-form" method="post" action={contactEndpoint} novalidate>
			<div class="fields">
				<div class="field half">
					<label for="name">Nombre</label>
					<input type="text" name="name" id="name" autocomplete="name" required />
				</div>
				<div class="field half">
					<label for="email">Correo</label>
					<input type="email" name="email" id="email" autocomplete="email" required />
				</div>
				<div class="field">
					<label for="subject">Asunto</label>
					<input type="text" name="subject" id="subject" placeholder="Ej. Propuesta / Vacante / Colaboración" />
				</div>
				<div class="field">
					<label for="message">Mensaje</label>
					<textarea name="message" id="message" rows="4" required placeholder="Cuéntame en qué puedo ayudarte..."></textarea>
				</div>

				<!-- Honeypot (anti-spam): debe quedarse vacío -->
				<div class="field" style="position:absolute; left:-9999px; top:auto; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden;">
					<label for="company">Company</label>
					<input type="text" name="company" id="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Configuración de FormSubmit -->
			<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Nuevo mensaje desde tu portafolio" />
			<input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
			<input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />

			<p id="contact-status" class="form-status" hidden></p>
			<ul class="actions">
				<li><input id="contact-submit" type="submit" value="Enviar" class="primary" /></li>
				<li><input type="reset" value="Limpiar" /></li>
			</ul>
		</form>

		<script is:inline>
			(function () {
				var form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
				var statusEl = document.getElementById('contact-status');
				var submitBtn = document.getElementById('contact-submit');
				
				if (!form || !statusEl || !submitBtn) return;

				function setStatus(kind, text) {
					statusEl.hidden = false;
					statusEl.classList.remove('is-success', 'is-error');
					statusEl.classList.add(kind === 'success' ? 'is-success' : 'is-error');
					statusEl.textContent = text;
				}

				form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
					e.preventDefault();
					statusEl.hidden = true;

					var nameInput = document.getElementById('name');
					var emailInput = document.getElementById('email');
					var messageInput = document.getElementById('message');

					if (!nameInput.value.trim() || !emailInput.value.trim() || !messageInput.value.trim()) {
						setStatus('error', 'Por favor completa todos los campos obligatorios.');
						return;
					}

					submitBtn.disabled = true;
					var oldValue = submitBtn.value;
					submitBtn.value = 'Enviando...';

					fetch(form.action, {
						method: 'POST',
						body: new FormData(form),
						headers: {
							'Accept': 'application/json'
						}
					})
						.then(function (response) {
							if (response.ok) {
								setStatus('success', '¡Gracias! Tu mensaje ha sido enviado exitosamente. Te responderé pronto a ' + emailInput.value);
								form.reset();
							} else {
								setStatus('error', 'Hubo un problema al enviar el mensaje. Por favor, intenta de nuevo.');
							}
						})
						.catch(function () {
							setStatus('error', 'Error de conexión. Verifica tu internet e intenta nuevamente.');
						})
						.finally(function () {
							submitBtn.disabled = false;
							submitBtn.value = oldValue;
						});
				});
			})();
		</script>

